   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<h5>Downloading and installing steps:</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/linkstackorg/linkstack/releases\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a></strong> the latest release of LinkStack and simply place the folder 'linkstack' or the contents of this folder in the root directory of your website.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>That's it! No coding no command line setup just plug and play.</h5>\n<br />\t<h6>Go through the first setup page:</h6>\n<p>When accessing your instance for the first time, you will be greeted by the first setup page.</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LinkStackOrg/branding/main/marketing/setup_wizard.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"650\" />\n</p><br /><p><a></a></p>",
